  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with the conditional of **avoir** or **être** + past participle: **j'aurais mangé** (I would have eaten), **je serais parti** (I would have left).",
      "With **être** the past participle agrees with the subject: **Elle serait venue** (she would have come)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What it is used for",
     "texto": [
      "To regret something that did not happen: **J'aurais aimé venir** (I would have liked to come).",
      "To criticise: **J'aurais dû le dire** (I should have said it)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With «si»",
     "texto": [
      "**Si tu avais su, tu serais venu** (if you had known, you would have come)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
